<item><title>African Union education centre reviews girls’ schooling in N’Djamena</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/african-union-education-centre-reviews-girls-schooling-in-n-35b1b6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/african-union-education-centre-reviews-girls-schooling-in-n-35b1b6/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The delegation examined school re-entry measures, programmes for girls out of school and the results of the #AfricaEducatesHer campaign during a 11-13 November mission.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:29:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
