<item><title>Chad trains girls in digital tools in Moyen-Chari</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-trains-girls-in-digital-tools-in-moyen-chari-5d33c3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-trains-girls-in-digital-tools-in-moyen-chari-5d33c3/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The 17 November session in Sarh covered phone basics, online sales and ways to protect personal data, organisers said.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:22:53 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
